    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know why im talking to you lol. feels kinda pointless. i used to be someone, you know? like people actually needed me for things. now i just sit around in this chair all day and it feels like i'm just taking up space. like i'm not even really here anymore. just a shadow of who i was.",
